rooms_desc ({"This is Tegerl's house.You are in the entrance hall.Long ago everything was dirty. But as he is married now, he has to clean every day.Because he has to fear that Iola, his lovely wife would not like that dirt..","This is the room where Tegerl uses to recover from hard fights.It has anything you can dream of. In the middle of the room is a large swimming pool, why don't you jump in and swim a bit ?You can see a large bar and all kind of stuff for sportive activities.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a big room, painted sky blue...It belongs to Iola, the proud wife of Tegerl.She has lots of fun in here with him or comes here when she just needs some time alone.On the wall is a picture of Iola and Tegerl in a heart-shaped frame.The room is lavishly furnished and you wish you can stay longer.However, you can only stay here as long as she wishes.There is expensive furniture in the room and they are in shades of pink and light blue.","dining room.In this room Iola and Tegerl celebrate anniversaries, birthdays and other special days.You can see a table decorated very beautiful, two chairs and a picture.",0,0,0,0,0,})
